  "title": "Agroforestry Tree Species Identification (India, Multimodal)",
  "description": "A multimodal tree species identification dataset covering 23,156 individual trees in agroforestry settings across Karnataka and Rajasthan, India. Each example links tree-level metadata and species labels with SkySat RGB crops, Sentinel-1 time series, Sentinel-2 time series, PlanetScope time series, and derived species-classification vectors. Raw Google Street View imagery is not redistributed; panorama IDs are retained to support reproducible workflows for users with appropriate API access.",
